# The ruling: "If Karn, Argent Defender and another artifact or creature enter the battlefield at the same time, neither one will cause triggered abilities to trigger." Show and Tell puts
# Bot1's Karn and Bot2's Baleful Strix onto the battlefield together: the Strix's enters ability (draw a card) does not trigger and the stack stays empty. Bot2 draws nothing:
# its hand is 7 after turn 2's cleanup, 6 once the Strix is put in, and stays 6 (a drawn card would make it 7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Karn, Argent Defender
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Baleful Strix
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Karn, Argent Defender)
Bot2.Choose(Baleful Strix)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Karn, Argent Defender
Bot2.Battlefield = Baleful Strix
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
